<title>ITALY: Italian jobless rate falls to 11.7 pct in July.</title>
<headline>Italian jobless rate falls to 11.7 pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute ISTAT gave the following unemployment data in its quarterly report.</p>
<p>    ITALIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	July 96     April 96     July 95</p>
<p>     Pct unemployed		  11.7	 12.3	 11.7</p>
<p>     Number of unemployed (mln) 2.999	 2.82	 2.67</p>
<p>Istat said seasonal factors played a large part in the fall in July's jobless total.</p>
<p>It added that there had been a pick up in employment in the service sector while the construction sector still showed no signs of generating fresh jobs.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
